
<p><span class="catchln" id="secs_53-216_to_53-237">Secs. 53-216 to 53-237. Offenses against chastity, generally.</span> Sections <a href ="chap_944.htm#sec_53-216">53-216</a> to <a href ="chap_944.htm#sec_53-237">53-237</a>, inclusive, are repealed.</p>
<p class="source-first">(1949 Rev., S. 8359, 8544&#x2013;8561, 8569, 8594, 8683; 1953, S. 3299d; 1959, P.A. 28, S. 190; 1963, P.A. 642, S. 58; 1967, P.A. 295, S. 2; 656, S. 54; 1969, P.A. 828, S. 214.)</p>
