<p><span class="catchln" id="sec_53-237a">Sec. 53-237a. Concealment of delivery: Class A misdemeanor.</span> (a) A person is guilty of concealment of delivery who intentionally conceals the delivery of any child, whether such child was delivered alive or dead.</p>
<p>(b) Concealment of delivery is a class A misdemeanor.</p>
<p class="source-first">(1971, P.A. 871, S. 56.)</p>
