<p><span class="catchln" id="secs_53-238_to_53-241">Secs. 53-238 to 53-241. Rape. Assault with intent to commit rape; with intent to carnally know female child. Examination for venereal disease of persons accused of violations of chapter.</span> Sections <a href ="chap_944.htm#sec_53-238">53-238</a> to <a href ="chap_944.htm#sec_53-241">53-241</a>, inclusive, are repealed.</p>
<p class="source-first">(1949 Rev., S. 8562&#x2013;8565; 1969, P.A. 828, S. 214.)</p>
